    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\ude08 FRIENDSHIP HURTS </h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104110/extras/eb96d5d489f06ea8c0a656444601a8db.poster.avif?t=1751936044\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104110/extras/eb96d5d489f06ea8c0a656444601a8db.webm?t=1751936044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104110/extras/eb96d5d489f06ea8c0a656444601a8db.mp4?t=1751936044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>GRAB. SWAP. KILL.</strong> Dominate the Underworld with lightning fast plays in this passive aggressive fighter for goblins &amp; sickos!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udca3 DIVE INTO DANGER </h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104110/extras/290d3c54247d63d71c7a43240d1f8ec9.poster.avif?t=1751936044\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104110/extras/290d3c54247d63d71c7a43240d1f8ec9.webm?t=1751936044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104110/extras/290d3c54247d63d71c7a43240d1f8ec9.mp4?t=1751936044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Master your slingshot-like <strong>Trick Hook</strong> to make devious reversals &amp; dish out punishment meant for you.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udc80 DENY DEATH </h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104110/extras/f64f9b39fb05ff155e7423e4000b36a6.poster.avif?t=1751936044\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104110/extras/f64f9b39fb05ff155e7423e4000b36a6.webm?t=1751936044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104110/extras/f64f9b39fb05ff155e7423e4000b36a6.mp4?t=1751936044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Parry anything.</strong> Cancel swaps, deflect traps, parry Death!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf6c CANDY CARNAGE </h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104110/extras/c4b986298e4bd099ae3f6403011ede39.poster.avif?t=1751936044\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104110/extras/c4b986298e4bd099ae3f6403011ede39.webm?t=1751936044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104110/extras/c4b986298e4bd099ae3f6403011ede39.mp4?t=1751936044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Items ain't cheap tricks.</strong> Get creative with the <i>Trick Hook</i> for surprising mixups.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udc96 TORMENT FOR EVERYONE</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104110/extras/86682c4f486a74e2ad1ab18d0394f84e.poster.avif?t=1751936044\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104110/extras/86682c4f486a74e2ad1ab18d0394f84e.webm?t=1751936044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104110/extras/86682c4f486a74e2ad1ab18d0394f84e.mp4?t=1751936044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Destroy the living to revive</strong> and get back in the action. Enjoy intense matches up till the last second, even if you're new.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf69 WELCOME TO DIEMART </h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104110/extras/30d744bdb463bc815faddbc40bc37998.poster.avif?t=1751936044\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104110/extras/30d744bdb463bc815faddbc40bc37998.webm?t=1751936044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104110/extras/30d744bdb463bc815faddbc40bc37998.mp4?t=1751936044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Collect <strong>VHS tapes</strong>, hangout in the DIEMART, and learn about the Underworld at <i>Dumpster Fire Video</i>. Or don't!",
